/*
 * Common — shared enumerations and placeholder types for YIL serialization.
 *
 * This module defines:
 *
 *   - TypeID:     identifiers for all YIL type kinds,
 *   - SymbolID:   identifiers for YIL symbol kinds,
 *   - ValueID:    identifiers for YIL value/instruction kinds,
 *   - SpecialFloatValue: encodings for special floating-point literals,
 *   - YILTypePlaceHolder: a temporary stand-in for unresolved types.
 *
 * These identifiers are used by the YIL serializer/deserializer to encode
 * and decode bytecode in a stable, architecture-independent format.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::serialize::common
 * @File: ymirc/lint/serialize/common.yr
 * @Author(s):
